<article class="env-example" id="983BFA">
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/983BFA">Example <span data-tag="983BFA">7.3.4.7</span>.</a> Let $\calX $ be an $n$-topos, $0 \leq n \leq \infty $. Then filtered colimits in $\calX $ are left exact. This follows immediately from Examples <a href="/tag/2964C2" data-tag="2964C2">7.3.4.4</a>, <a href="/tag/71AD3D" data-tag="71AD3D">7.3.4.5</a>, and <a href="/tag/307F33" data-tag="307F33">7.3.4.6</a>. </p>
</article>